# Where the demo server is. Optional: left unset, the client uses the page's own
# host on port 8790, which is right whenever the two run on the same machine.
#
# Set it when they do not — a phone on the LAN opening this client, for instance,
# resolves `localhost` to itself.
#
# Everything else — credentials, conversation language, voice, model — lives in the
# server's .env. This client sends nothing but the character you pick.
NEXT_PUBLIC_DEMO_SERVER_URL=
